#: source/setup/ecosystem.rst:4
msgid "Ecosystem"
msgstr "生态系统"

#: source/setup/ecosystem.rst:6
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab is a fully open-source framework for building, training, and "
"testing robot-learning systems in simulation. It embraces a modular design "
"that supports multiple physics backends, rendering backends, RL libraries, "
"and various robot-learning workflows spanning from reinforcement learning, "
"imitation learning, teleoperation, and post-training."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab "
"是一个完全开源的框架，用于在仿真中构建、训练和测试机器人学习系统。它采用模块化设计，支持多种物理后端、渲染后端和强化学习库，涵盖强化学习、模仿学习、遥操作及后训练等机器人学习流程。"

#: source/setup/ecosystem.rst:12
msgid ""
"At the core of Isaac Lab, we focus heavily on parallelized GPU-accelerated "
"simulation. Isaac Lab provides warp-based integration with `Newton`_, "
"allowing for efficient CUDA graphing of simulation and MDP pipelines. "
"Additionally, the `OvPhysX`_ backend provides PhysX support through a "
"lightweight standalone library package. Similarly, `OvRTX`_ introduces RTX "
"rendering capabilities through an optional standalone python dependency. "
"This architecture promotes a fully customized experience for users to choose"
" from a selection of different physics and rendering engines."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 的核心重点是并行化的 GPU 加速仿真。它基于 Warp 与 `Newton`_ 集成，使仿真和 MDP 流程能够高效使用 CUDA"
" 图。此外， `OvPhysX`_ 通过轻量的独立运行库提供 PhysX 支持， `OvRTX`_ 则通过可选的独立 Python 依赖提供 RTX "
"渲染。用户可以根据需要选择不同的物理引擎与渲染引擎。"

#: source/setup/ecosystem.rst:20
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab is not itself a simulator. It provides a framework for defining "
"concepts such as the scene, asset, sensors, actuators, controllers, and "
"tasks, which can run on multiple physics and rendering backends. The shared "
"backend interface lets a supported environment keep the same structure while"
" its preset selects the runtime. See :ref:`backend-architecture` for the "
"implementation model."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab "
"本身不是仿真器，而是用于定义场景、资产、传感器、执行器、控制器和任务等概念的框架，可以运行在多种物理与渲染后端上。借助统一的后端接口，受支持的环境可以保持相同结构，再通过预设选择运行时。实现方式见"
" :ref:`backend-architecture` 。"

#: source/setup/ecosystem.rst:28
msgid "Modular Multi-Backend Physics and Rendering"
msgstr "模块化的多后端物理仿真与渲染"

#: source/setup/ecosystem.rst:30
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab supports two physics backends, with PhysX support available "
"through either a Kit-based Isaac Sim PhysX implementation and a standalone "
"(Kit-less) OvPhysX implementation."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 支持两类物理后端，其中 PhysX 可以通过基于 Kit 的 Isaac Sim PhysX 实现，也可以通过不依赖 Kit 的独立"
" OvPhysX 实现。"

